\layout Section*

Coursework
\layout Standard

For this coursework you will build a discrete time simulation of a queue
 in MATLAB.
 You will investigate the statistics associated with this simulation and
 compare them with analytically computed values.
 
\layout Enumerate

Your simulation will consist of a discrete Markov model, in particular a
 birth death process.
 Use discrete time-steps of 
\begin_inset Formula $\Delta t=0.01$
\end_inset 

.
